}`

Output:
`Email: UPI paid 499
SMS: UPI paid 499
Email: Card paid 1200
SMS: Card paid 1200
unknown cash`

Adding a Wallet payment means a new class and one factory line — the Shop never changes (Open/Closed). Shop depends on the Payment and Listener **interfaces** (Dependency Inversion).

